            "brake_cms2": 60,
            "max_speed_cms": 200,
            "reverse_factor_pct": 50,
            "turn_rate_mdeg_s": 8000
          }
        },
        "note": "Doc 41 cut RS.6a (Q-41-15, Q-41-29): Tycho Mutual's heavy recovery crawler, 130 t dry (provisional), tracked, unarmed, a crew of two. logistics.recovery_profile heavy couples at the optimized speed, and logistics.tow_cap_t 400 caps the casualty's laden mass at 400 t in place of twice its own (the owner's ruling of 2026-11-06), so it takes a fuelled Dray-P with her bay rigs aboard. Its own stores are a tool locker (3 t / 6 m3 stow.bulk). It rides in a Tycho lifter's bay; a registered design the Stickney yard builds at its bill.",
